              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PlumTaro5415"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Went up to our neighbors house for an impromptu Root Beer Social. I took all the ingredients; Genuine A&amp;W Root Beer &amp; Vanilla Ice Cream. For fun I also took my can of Whipped Cream &amp; jar of Marishino Cherries. Didn't realize that what I made actually had a name! Gourmet Root Beer Floats! They were delicious &amp; everyone loved them. It's not a true Root Beer Float unless genuine A &amp; W Root Beer is used!",
